Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.85,0:00:19.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.93,0:00:24.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These words lured men to\Nthe Grand Line in pursuit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.31,0:00:26.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of dreams greater than\Nthey'd ever dared to imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.83,0:00:29.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.59,0:00:35.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come aboard and bring along\Nall your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.69,0:00:40.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\Nthat we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.49,0:00:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.47,0:00:52.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compass left behind,\Nit'll only slow us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.67,0:00:58.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your heart will be your guide,\Nraise the sails and take the helm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.55,0:01:04.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That legendary place that\Nthe end of the map reveals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.19,0:01:10.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is only legendary until\Nsomeone proves it real.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.97,0:01:14.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through it all, through\Nall the trouble of times.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.55,0:01:16.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through the heartache\Nand through the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.89,0:01:21.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know that I will be there to stand by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.89,0:01:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like I know you'll stand by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.23,0:01:30.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So come aboard and bring along\Nall your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.41,0:01:36.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\Nthat we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.15,0:01:42.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's always room for you\Nif you want to be my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.13,0:01:46.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are, we are on a cruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.35,0:01:49.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.25,0:01:58.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, at daybreak, the pirates will be\Nlanding at this shore to begin their attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.47,0:02:02.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the only way they'll be able to get\Nto the village is to go up this slope.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.95,0:02:06.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rest of the shoreline is sheer\Ncliffs, so they have to come through here.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:04.12,0:02:07.09,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(734,734)\3c&H1E1E1E&\c&H1E1E1E&\bord2.3\1a&HFF&\t(692,734,\1a&H00&)\t(2236,2277,\1a&HFF&)}The Slope
Dialogue: 2,0:02:04.12,0:02:07.09,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(734,734)\c&HE7E6E6&\bord0\4a&HFF&}The Slope
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.85,0:02:09.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we can fight them while they're\Nfunneled into that narrow pass,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.73,0:02:12.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,their numbers won't mean anything\Nand the village will be protected.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.83,0:02:14.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, sounds pretty easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.41,0:02:17.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talking about it is, but\Nvictory depends on our strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.29,0:02:18.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it you guys can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.83,0:02:20.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.29,0:02:22.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I stretch. I steal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.31,0:02:23.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.85,0:02:25.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, there's no way better to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.61,0:02:26.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just make it up funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.01,0:02:28.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.85,0:02:34.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, Klahadore, welcome back. How is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.55,0:02:35.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's resting now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.19,0:02:37.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was quite exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.57,0:02:42.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I leave town for a few hours\Nto tend to some errands,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.79,0:02:44.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and everything falls to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.77,0:02:47.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That Usopp certainly knows how\Nto cause trouble, doesn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.57,0:02:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.48,0:02:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And on top of everything else he's done\Ntoday, he claimed you were a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.85,0:02:55.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't think of a more outrageous lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.69,0:03:00.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.13,0:03:05.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.47,0:03:09.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's a present, of course,\Nfrom Miss Kaya to you, Klahadore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.31,0:03:11.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been three years since\Nyou came to this mansion,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.69,0:03:14.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and this gift is to say\Nthank you for your hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.61,0:03:16.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a commemoration of sorts. How nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.67,0:03:20.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The glasses you're wearing are always\Nslipping and you have to push them back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.91,0:03:23.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the lady of the house custom\Nordered a new pair for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.71,0:03:27.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't she just the most thoughtful\Nyoung woman you've ever met?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.09,0:03:31.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How appropriate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.57,0:03:34.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow will be a day\Nworth commemorating.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.17,0:03:41.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a crescent moon tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.41,0:03:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.73,0:03:47.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's on nights like these\Nthat I truly feel alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.43,0:03:51.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My heart races and my\Nblood boils in my veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.87,0:03:57.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alto, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.57,0:04:00.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would you do such a\Nthing to Miss Kaya's present?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.97,0:04:03.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'll be receiving a gift, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.83,0:04:05.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it won't be glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.57,0:04:09.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be her entire estate. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.77,0:04:11.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.13,0:04:14.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose there's no reason to\Ncarry on the act any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.49,0:04:19.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In a few hours, the village will\Nbe mourning the unforeseen tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.57,0:04:27.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three long years I've\Nquietly waited for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.25,0:04:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.16,0:04:29.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.08,0:04:30.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.05,0:04:49.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Django!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.23,0:04:53.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Django, it's almost daybreak.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.61,0:04:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to get moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.47,0:04:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.95,0:04:59.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good morning, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.65,0:05:01.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.97,0:05:04.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only the sun can wake me up\Nand live to tell about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.99,0:05:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do I make myself clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.53,0:05:08.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's in a really bad mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.41,0:05:10.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mornings are the worst. Just look.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.65,0:05:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The moon is still up, so the\Nsun couldn't have woken me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.15,0:05:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, which one of you did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.19,0:05:17.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No apologies, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.49,0:05:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're very sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.95,0:05:24.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good morning, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.83,0:05:26.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.41,0:05:27.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was mad just a second ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.03,0:05:28.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.94,0:05:32.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's in a better mood now, and that's all\Nthat matters, so keep your big trap shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.23,0:05:33.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attention, men.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:33.00,0:05:35.92,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(483,435)\an8\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,60)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(441,483,\1a&H00&)\t(2485,2527,\1a&HFF&)}"One-Two" Jango\NActing Captain of the Black Cat Pirates
Dialogue: 2,0:05:33.00,0:05:35.92,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(483,435)\an8\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,60)\3c&HFAFAFB&\c&HFAFAFB&\1a&HFF&\t(441,483,\1a&H00&)\t(2485,2527,\1a&HFF&)\4a&HFF&}"One-Two" Jango\NActing Captain of the Black Cat Pirates
Dialogue: 3,0:05:33.00,0:05:35.92,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(483,435)\an8\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,60)\c&HFAFAFB&\4a&HFF&}"One-Two" Jango\NActing Captain of the Black Cat Pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.57,0:05:35.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's set sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.91,0:05:43.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, I'm a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.89,0:05:47.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way they'll be able\Nto make it up this slope now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.69,0:05:51.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All this oil we put here should keep them\Noccupied while we go to work on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.71,0:05:54.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're going to be busy slipping and\Nsliding around like a bunch of idiots,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.63,0:05:57.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we show up and beat\Nthe crap out of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.73,0:05:59.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, so that's your plan, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.49,0:06:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.40,0:06:02.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to defend the village\Nno matter what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.01,0:06:06.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's just hope none of us slip on that\Noil and end up down there with them,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.23,0:06:08.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because that would be like\Nsliding into a meat grinder.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.67,0:06:10.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp, I gotta hand it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.65,0:06:12.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're pretty good at fighting dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.87,0:06:14.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.43,0:06:16.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There isn't anyone alive\Nwho can best me with a
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.59,0:06:19.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,slingshot or beat me at\Nthe art of fighting dirty!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.27,0:06:25.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.23,0:06:27.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.55,0:06:45.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.87,0:06:47.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, men.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.07,0:06:49.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.39,0:06:52.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ashore, crash the village,\Nhead for the mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.83,0:06:53.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aye, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.15,0:06:57.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain, there are already\Ntwo boats here. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.57,0:06:59.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shall I investigate?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.13,0:07:01.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave them for later.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.15,0:07:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They don't look like treasure ships to\Nme, and we have a schedule to keep...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.23,0:07:07.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.03,0:07:12.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were gonna fight the\Nsun's up. What's the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.09,0:07:14.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, maybe they overslept
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.11,0:07:21.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, maybe I'm hearing things,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.37,0:07:24.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it sounds like battle\Ncries from somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.77,0:07:31.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I definitely hear them!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.89,0:07:34.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it can't be, what can't be?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.93,0:07:37.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there's a shore just\Nlike this to the north.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.05,0:07:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They went.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.81,0:07:42.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're at the wrong shore!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.51,0:07:43.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.47,0:07:45.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, this is where they\Nhad their secret meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.31,0:07:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I just assumed, okay
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.97,0:07:50.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to hurry before\Nthey make it to the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.67,0:07:51.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.77,0:07:54.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to head directly north\Nfrom here if you run you can make
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.73,0:07:57.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it in three minutes the terrain\Nthere is almost exactly the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.75,0:08:00.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So all we need to do is\Nstop them at the slope?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.01,0:08:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.07,0:08:07.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If those filthy pirates are at the North\NShore, then they've already seen our boats!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.21,0:08:08.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll take our treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.71,0:08:11.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be there in 20 seconds! Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.67,0:08:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My brilliant oil strategy\Nwas all for nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.21,0:08:16.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My precious treasure...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.99,0:08:18.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.93,0:08:19.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.91,0:08:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.17,0:08:25.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.08,0:08:25.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.89,0:08:29.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go, you moron! Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.37,0:08:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.69,0:08:32.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.87,0:08:40.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but you understand\Nthe treasure's in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.97,0:08:43.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That oil won't be a\Nproblem for you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.69,0:08:45.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That girl's gonna pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.49,0:08:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear all my life they'll\Nnever set foot in my village.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.27,0:08:56.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That Luffy sure has a good runner.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.39,0:08:58.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's so far ahead, I can't\Neven see him anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.59,0:09:03.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run straight north!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.79,0:09:08.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those mongrels are in big trouble if\Nthey so much as look at my treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.75,0:09:16.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an ambush!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.11,0:09:18.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody's up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.85,0:09:21.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.13,0:09:35.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the legendary Captain Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.27,0:09:37.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.43,0:09:45.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't supposed to\Nbe the first one here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.93,0:09:47.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was running way ahead of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.75,0:09:49.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't handle these guys alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.27,0:09:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.18,0:09:57.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to get past this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.77,0:10:02.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The village!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.99,0:10:04.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That can't be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.19,0:10:08.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said run north, and I ran in a coldish\Ndirection, so I should be at the shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.59,0:10:15.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's you. I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.53,0:10:18.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're one of the troublesome\Nbrats who overheard our plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.45,0:10:19.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.69,0:10:20.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm warning you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.01,0:10:22.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave here while you still can!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.99,0:10:27.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't, my 100 million\Ncrewmen will massacre all of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.89,0:10:31.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One hundred million?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.25,0:10:34.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are we really supposed\Nto believe that? No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.37,0:10:35.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One hundred million?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.75,0:10:36.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.66,0:10:38.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain, he's obviously lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.25,0:10:40.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then it's time to call his bluff.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.13,0:10:41.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They saw through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.77,0:10:45.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That guy seriously thought he\Ncould fool us. What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.55,0:10:47.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been lying to us this whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.01,0:10:49.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Jango, take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.89,0:10:50.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, is it bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.05,0:10:52.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, sir, it's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.13,0:10:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We searched those other ships and\Nfound a huge load of treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.89,0:10:58.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to say how much, but I bet\Nit's around five million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.93,0:10:59.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.31,0:11:01.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Five million berries?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.49,0:11:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How in the world did those guys\Nget a hold of so much treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.45,0:11:09.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see you found my loot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.15,0:11:11.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you can have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.53,0:11:13.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just gonna let\Nus take your treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.93,0:11:14.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.67,0:11:19.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just turn around and forget all about\Nthis place, and the treasure is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.69,0:11:22.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't think people that\Nstupid actually existed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.41,0:11:25.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this point, he's just\Nembarrassing himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.35,0:11:28.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, do you know what a pirate is?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.03,0:11:32.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to take this treasure, and\Nthere's nothing you can do about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.81,0:11:36.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there is no way we're turning\Nback until we get where we came for.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.73,0:11:39.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.81,0:11:42.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.29,0:11:46.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the count of one, two,\NJango, you'll let us by.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.41,0:11:49.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's that strange weapon from before.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.87,0:11:51.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.89,0:11:56.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you ever try to get\Nmy heart and treasure away!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.61,0:12:00.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My head!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.55,0:12:03.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, who is this crazy girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.31,0:12:05.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain, this isn't the time\Nto be hypnotizing yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.39,0:12:07.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got a mission to carry out, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.99,0:12:11.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That treasure boat is mine, and I'm not\Ngoing to let you have a single bearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.49,0:12:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.40,0:12:15.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, you better clear out, because\NI'm coming down there to get it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.53,0:12:16.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That really hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.59,0:12:18.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who said you could give them my treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.25,0:12:19.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got what you deserve!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.16,0:12:20.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't give them the treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.99,0:12:22.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just said I would give it to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.03,0:12:25.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the same thing, and\NI just saved your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.89,0:12:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.80,0:12:28.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I forgot to\Nmention it to you earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.97,0:12:30.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't ever watch his ring routine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.07,0:12:32.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That weirdo's a hypnotist.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.61,0:12:35.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hypnotist?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.53,0:12:36.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So where's Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.85,0:12:37.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a fast runner.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.95,0:12:39.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought he'd be here way ahead of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.69,0:12:40.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.61,0:12:44.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He either got lost or he\Nchickened out at the last minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.21,0:12:47.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing that could keep\Nhim from a fight is getting lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.87,0:12:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right when we need him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.67,0:12:51.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go ahead and take command here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.37,0:12:53.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's about time you\Ngo and kick their butts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.57,0:12:54.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.48,0:12:55.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.40,0:12:58.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't take on a boatload\Nof vicious pirates by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.41,0:12:59.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.75,0:13:01.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What, like I'm gonna do any fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.61,0:13:05.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beneath this calm exterior lies\Nthe abject terror of a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.09,0:13:06.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, so you think you're scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.91,0:13:09.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm so scared I am\Nliterally about to cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.85,0:13:11.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, your eyes are completely dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.07,0:13:13.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll have to do better than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.35,0:13:14.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Liars can smell their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.57,0:13:15.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just your upper lip.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.95,0:13:17.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got beat up by...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.23,0:13:19.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have time for this nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.37,0:13:22.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, men, let's get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.39,0:13:24.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crush them and move to the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.45,0:13:29.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.67,0:13:30.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.79,0:13:32.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have some caltrops.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.11,0:13:34.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are just what the doctor ordered.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.41,0:13:35.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me have some.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.77,0:13:40.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna love this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.69,0:13:41.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caltrups! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.93,0:13:57.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, if you're still alive when I\Nget out of here, I'm gonna kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.09,0:14:06.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take that oil!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.05,0:14:16.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, how do I get to the\Nnorth shore from here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.65,0:14:17.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run straight north!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.07,0:14:19.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run straight north!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.61,0:14:21.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run straight north!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.99,0:14:28.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which way is north?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.85,0:14:35.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes! We got him! Check it out! Here comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.39,0:14:37.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The lead star!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.65,0:14:43.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastard. Way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.43,0:14:45.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're quite the warrior after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.23,0:14:47.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you got this handled,\Nso I'll just take a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.53,0:14:49.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you haven't done anything yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.89,0:14:50.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.43,0:14:53.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are caltrops behind us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.23,0:14:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.14,0:14:57.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You dropped those things behind us, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.73,0:14:59.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.87,0:15:08.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.78,0:15:12.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you really thought you\Nwere going to stop us down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.37,0:15:15.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, fellas!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.89,0:15:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Kuro hates waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.93,0:15:23.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You again?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.35,0:15:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go of me, you jackass!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.53,0:15:27.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want some more?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.71,0:15:29.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, have some!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.65,0:15:30.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a little more!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.67,0:15:32.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will never...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.15,0:15:36.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let you step foot in that village!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.59,0:15:40.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I did was lie like I always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.69,0:15:47.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, today will be like every other\Nday in that sleepy little town.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.57,0:15:50.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cause you and your cronies\Nwill never set foot in it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.23,0:15:51.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shots?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.95,0:15:57.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stupid girls?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.29,0:16:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.55,0:16:03.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.73,0:16:07.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up I won't tell you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.63,0:16:12.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've wasted enough time playing pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.57,0:16:15.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit bothering with him\Nand move to the village!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.11,0:16:18.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or have you forgotten that this\Nis Captain Kuro's operation,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.39,0:16:22.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and he doesn't look favorably on his\Nwell-laid plans being ruined by idiots?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.83,0:16:23.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll kill us all!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.17,0:16:25.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you understand that, you cretins?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.07,0:16:27.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.33,0:16:28.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get to the village!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.67,0:16:34.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't go any further!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.63,0:16:37.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.21,0:16:39.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turn back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.53,0:16:42.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't take another step. Get off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.03,0:16:51.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.31,0:16:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just leave this village alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.37,0:16:55.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're good people.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.99,0:16:57.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They don't deserve this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.87,0:17:00.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love this place. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.67,0:17:18.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this, Captain Django?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.23,0:17:22.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody told us that killers like\Nthose were going to be here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.79,0:17:23.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's about time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.75,0:17:30.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that the best those\Npirates can dish out?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.71,0:17:32.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I was hoping for a challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.93,0:17:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.89,0:17:37.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After leaving me down there, you're\Nlucky I'm not kicking your butt, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.79,0:17:39.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp, you big bonehead!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.47,0:17:42.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You never told me which\Ndirection was north!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.77,0:17:45.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are these guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.33,0:17:53.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.63,0:17:56.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't appreciate tardiness, not one bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.91,0:18:01.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They know full well what happens to those\Nwho are foolish enough to upset my plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.65,0:18:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do they think they can\Ntake their sweet time?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.73,0:18:15.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if they have forgotten the\Nconsequences of disappointing me,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.71,0:18:18.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll kill them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.91,0:18:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.45,0:18:32.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was great!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.65,0:18:34.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are really that strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.77,0:18:37.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.69,0:18:38.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you have been slower?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.03,0:18:40.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What took you so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.01,0:18:44.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one who pushed me down\Nthat oil slick so you could get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.39,0:18:45.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.31,0:18:46.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I slipped, you fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.15,0:18:48.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least one of us made it out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.99,0:18:51.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's better than both of\Nus being stuck at the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.43,0:18:53.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It should have just been you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.63,0:18:55.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run straight north, he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.13,0:18:56.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just great.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.13,0:18:59.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, how am I supposed to know\Nwhich way north even is out here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.39,0:19:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.30,0:19:04.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one who ran away so sure\Nof yourself, ready to take on anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.17,0:19:07.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just got so excited, I\Nstarted running, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.13,0:19:12.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sun rises high in the sky now, and that\Nmeans Captain Kuro goes very impatient.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.41,0:19:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Men, don't just lie there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.03,0:19:18.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't tell me you're\Ngoing to let them win.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.31,0:19:20.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're just a couple of idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.21,0:19:29.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fact is, we don't have time to\Nlollygag around here any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.23,0:19:33.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If our enemy is strong, then we\Nmust become stronger than them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.53,0:19:36.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, stare deeply into this ring now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.43,0:19:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will count one to jungle and after\Nthat you will all begin to grow stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.97,0:19:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your wounds will heal and you will grow\Nstronger still so what is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.49,0:19:47.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks weird. Looks like hypnosis.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.23,0:19:49.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's trying to convince them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.51,0:19:52.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're stronger than they\Nare. That'll work. One...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.61,0:19:54.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,true
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.29,0:20:01.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.15,0:20:16.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That one guy completely\Ndestroyed the cliff!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.27,0:20:19.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's what I call power!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.91,0:20:22.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always thought hypnotizing\Npeople was a bunch of crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.95,0:20:24.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was just one of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.35,0:20:26.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Imagine what the whole crew can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.89,0:20:31.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now go, and strike down\Nall who stand in your way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.09,0:20:45.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys, you might want to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.81,0:20:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, you and I will take it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.31,0:20:52.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.27,0:20:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.05,0:20:58.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.01,0:21:06.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you let that\Nfreak hypnotize you too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.75,0:21:15.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, he really is a simple-minded idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.37,0:21:39.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Captain Kuro, you made\None hell of a miscalculation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.39,0:21:42.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These are not your average village idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.47,0:22:03.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's he going?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.41,0:22:08.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.73,0:22:19.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.03,0:22:21.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tear it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.63,0:22:24.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's going to destroy our ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.33,0:22:38.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, he's gonna crush\Nus with it, everybody run!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.41,0:22:41.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.32,0:22:42.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain, do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.49,0:22:49.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two, jungle, you will fall asleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.65,0:22:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two, jungle!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.81,0:22:57.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.43,0:23:32.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like those guys are probably\Ndown for the count, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.31,0:23:33.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.49,0:23:34.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.51,0:23:36.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Luffy's still trapped\Nunderneath that cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.85,0:23:37.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just look.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.23,0:23:39.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Relax, he's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.87,0:23:43.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should really worry about your\Nown injuries by the looks of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.63,0:23:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn that little brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.19,0:23:47.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now our whole plan's shot to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.99,0:23:49.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I gonna do with this mess?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.55,0:23:55.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Kuro sees this and he'll kill us!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.97,0:23:58.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poochie, come check this out!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.67,0:24:00.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's some bad stuff going down!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.83,0:24:01.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.75,0:24:05.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I forgot we still have our trump card.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.19,0:24:07.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come forth!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.23,0:24:08.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meowban brothers!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.75,0:24:23.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like the butler\Nfrom Kaia's mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.35,0:24:25.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's so early in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.33,0:24:27.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is he walking to the shore?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.39,0:24:55.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was in my grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.75,0:24:58.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I wouldn't let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.47,0:25:02.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,La la la la.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.19,0:25:03.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My only dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.59,0:25:05.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,La la la la la.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.77,0:25:09.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't stop chasing it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.19,0:25:11.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until it comes true.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.51,0:25:16.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if the world ever changes?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.97,0:25:19.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I call out your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.05,0:25:26.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We return to the time when\Neverything's the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.03,0:25:33.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as I'm with you,\Nmy memories won't fade.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.69,0:25:38.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Waiting for that one true dream?

